            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mycrowd"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this basic recipe because it allows for variations. I'm so impressed by the substitution of ingredients, especially sweeteners that I've read in the comments. I do not add sweetener at all. I followed the recipe exactly except I made larger corn muffins. I made six. I do like a little spice so I put a square of pepper jack cheese in the middle before I bake them and turned out perfectly!",
            "datePublished": "2026-01-01T17:01:36.410Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
