            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NimbleBeer5761"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful, easy recipe. Did not have milk, so used 4 level tablespoons powdered buttermilk and a cup of water. I did replace sugar 1:1 with erythritol to cut down on sugar intake. I also used avocado oil in place of canola because that's what I have on hand. Muffins baked for 15 minutes in 12 silicone muffin cups. They were excellent with just a pat of butter. Will surely make these again!",
            "datePublished": "2023-03-05T20:12:11.105Z"
          },
          {
