            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "WisePork9624"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted 2/3 cup plain Greek yogurt and 1/2 cup milk for the 1 cup milk called for in the recipe, because of the previous comments about the muffins baking up dry. The resulting muffins were moist and sufficiently sweet to my taste. Thus adjusted, the recipe made 14 muffins. In my next batch, I plan to stir in a cup of currants for a little additional sweetness.",
            "datePublished": "2023-02-21T19:38:45.050Z"
          },
